ULTRA (inductive knowledge-graph reasoning), ICLR 2024
  Source:  https://github.com/DeepGraphLearning/ULTRA (commit 427966a)
  Copyright (c) 2023 MilaGraph
  License: MIT

  A MINIMAL INFERENCE SUBSET of the ULTRA model code is VENDORED into this
  package under src/latence_linkpred_ultra/_vendor/ultra/:
    - models.py       (Ultra, RelNBFNet, EntityNBFNet, QueryNBFNet)
    - base_nbfnet.py  (BaseNBFNet)
    - layers.py       (GeneralizedRelationalConv)
    - tasks.py        (build_relation_graph, all_negative, compute_ranking, ...)
  The files are verbatim upstream except a single import in models.py made
  relative so the subset resolves inside this package; the algorithm is
  byte-for-byte upstream. The upstream MIT LICENSE ships alongside them at
  src/latence_linkpred_ultra/_vendor/ultra/LICENSE.

  NO ULTRA model WEIGHTS are vendored. The pretrained checkpoint is a config
  path/id (default "ultra_3g"); the released ULTRA weights are MIT
  (Hugging Face model cards mgalkin/ultra_3g, ultra_4g, ultra_50g: license: mit)
  and are downloaded/provided by the operator, never bundled here.

